<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0687_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kyler</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d like to scrap you again sometime.\nCan we swap numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO! Good looks!\nThe fish heard. They scared now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! Oh well!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d like to scrap you again\nsometime. Can we swap\fnumbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You right nearby, but the phone make\nyou feel far.\rDon’t be shy. Come talk in person! I’m\nthe one with the bucket.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some people say “You ain’t gotta give\nBait to your caught homies,” but I’m\fdifferent.\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} go HARD.\rSo I feed it good stuff, brush it, pet\nit, show it LOVE.\fIt’s spoiled. It won’t eat cheap bait\fno more.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesterday I went fishin’ and knocked\nout a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\rI could go to the mountains, forest,\ncaves, wherever, for other homies.\rBut I REALLY like homies like {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\nWet ones.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The biggest homie is always the one you\nALMOST caught, you know?\rI ALMOST caught a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} when it\ndipped! SO disappointed!\rFish with all your might!\nAyo! FIGHT! ...That’s my motto.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m SICK of fishin’. I’d rather scrap\nyou!\rAyo! I’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nI’ll still be fishin’. While I wait.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? We made plans to meet on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} for a scrap, right?\fAyo! Hurry up and get here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The real draw of fishin’ is you never\nknow what you gon’ catch.\rOne day maybe I’ll pull up a LEGENDARY\nhomie on my line...\rLike RAIKOU. Skippin’ all over the\nplace, maybe it slip and land in the\fsea...\rCould I accidentally catch RAIKOU\nfishin’?\r...I been tryin’ for six years. It’s\ngon’ happen. It’s GONNA happen.</language>
	</row>
</body>
